# Multi-Agent System

## Overview
This workflow demonstrates a multi-agent AI system built with n8n. It explores how multiple AI agents can work together to handle tasks, process information, and support a coordinated workflow.

## Key Features
- Multi-agent workflow architecture
- AI-powered task processing
- Coordination between AI agents
- Automated workflow execution using n8n

## Technologies Used
- n8n
- Google Gemini
- AI Agents
- JavaScript
- LangChain

## Workflow Purpose
The purpose of this project is to explore multi-agent automation and understand how different AI agents can collaborate within a single automated system.

## Setup Instructions
1. Download the workflow JSON file.
2. Import it into your n8n instance.
3. Configure your own credentials and required integrations.
4. Review the agent configurations.
5. Execute the workflow to test the system.
